<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1843079829"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:03.077"><div begin="9.002" end="27.831" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="9.002" end="12.598" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="9.002" end="11.781">我已做好了所有准</span><span begin="11.781" end="12.598">备</span></p><p begin="14.315" end="17.879" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.315" end="17.101">随时将自己燃尽成</span><span begin="17.101" end="17.879">灰</span></p><p begin="19.718" end="22.233" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.718" end="21.100">一场美梦</span><span begin="21.100" end="21.595">对不</span><span begin="21.595" end="22.233">对</span></p><p begin="22.433" end="24.754" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.433" end="23.701">一句可惜</span><span begin="23.701" end="24.186">会不</span><span begin="24.186" end="24.754">会</span></p><p begin="25.057" end="27.831" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.057" end="26.478">其实没什</span><span begin="26.478" end="26.990">幺可</span><span begin="26.990" end="27.831">贵</span></p></div><div begin="30.432" end="49.074" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="30.432" end="33.909" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.432" end="33.137">云层遮盖落日的余</span><span begin="33.137" end="33.909">晖</span></p><p begin="35.656" end="39.087" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.656" end="38.440">身体需在入夜前麻</span><span begin="38.440" end="39.087">醉</span></p><p begin="41.067" end="43.618" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.067" end="42.460">理性的话</span><span begin="42.460" end="42.977">太尖</span><span begin="42.977" end="43.618">锐</span></p><p begin="43.768" end="46.355" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.768" end="45.125">冲动终将</span><span begin="45.125" end="45.613">会消</span><span begin="45.613" end="46.355">退</span></p><p begin="46.485" end="49.074" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.485" end="47.748">不如就随</span><span begin="47.748" end="48.236">它破</span><span begin="48.236" end="49.074">碎